                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I bought this game over a decade back and still have fond memories. It's a fun mashup of fantasy combat and sports management system. I had always wanted to find a game with this setup and was thrilled to be pointed to this one. Recommended for those who like old school games and either Blood Bowl or Football Manager and turn based strategy.\n\nIt's a lot of fun to work your way up from a small nothing team with one guy and little in the way of equipment and skills to a much more successful squad. You get strongly invested in each match as a win can set you up well for later success and a loss can sink you, especially early on. Good, logical skill progression and good variety of development paths. Fun free agent bidding aspect. A very solid game.",
